{
  "id": "g-dd-support-quality-low-code",
  "name": "Support Quality & Agents (low-code)",
  "description": "CSAT month by month, the SLA against the target in kpi_targets and how often a ticket is reopened; then each channel's resolution times and its satisfaction side by side; then the agents, with their volume, average resolution, CSAT and SLA.",
  "connection_id": "rbt-sample-northwind-duckdb-4f2",
  "exported_report_code": "g-dd-support-quality-low-code",
  "state": {
    "widgets": [
      {
        "id": "w-dd22-text-title",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPosition": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1
        },
        "dataSource": null,
        "displayConfig": {
          "textContent": "## Support Quality & Agents\n\nChat leaves people happiest and no faster: CSAT 4.4 on chat against 4.07 on the phone, 3.83 by email and 3.67 on the web form, while a ticket takes 60 to 63 hours to resolve whichever channel it arrives on - chat's median, 62.63 hours, is the longest of the four against the web form's 60.28. So chat buys satisfaction, not speed. Every team clears the 90% SLA target, from 90.5% in Billing to 91.5% in Technical, and the 32 agents sit between 3.86 and 4.13 CSAT, so there is no one to single out for coaching.\n\nQuality over time first - CSAT month by month, the SLA against its target from `kpi_targets`, and how often a ticket comes back - then the two sides of a channel's service, how fast it resolves and how happy it leaves people, and last the agents themselves. **Click the CSAT column** to sort the leaderboard by satisfaction instead of volume. The boxplot counts resolved tickets only: an open ticket has no resolution time. The window defaults to the last 12 months, the monthly review's own year."
        },
        "columns": null,
        "shape": null
      },
      {
        "id": "w-dd22-trend-csat",
        "type": "trend",
        "gridPosition": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 3
        },
        "dataSource": {
          "mode": "visual",
          "visualQuery": {
            "kind": "cube",
            "cubeId": "dd-support",
            "table": "",
            "filters": [],
            "summarize": [],
            "groupBy": [],
            "sort": [],
            "limit": 500,
            "cubeSelection": {
              "dimensions": [
                "OpenedAt.month"
              ],
              "measures": [
                "AvgCsat"
              ],
              "segments": [],
              "filters": [
                {
                  "member": "OpenedAt",
                  "operator": "lt",
                  "values": [
                    "${dateTo__next_day}"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "granularities": {
                "OpenedAt": "month"
              },
              "order": [
                {
                  "member": "OpenedAt",
                  "dir": "asc"
                }
              ],
              "limit": null,
              "paramBindings": [
                {
                  "param": "team",
                  "member": "Team",
                  "operator": "equals"
                },
                {
                  "param": "dateFrom",
                  "member": "OpenedAt",
                  "operator": "greater_or_equal"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "generatedSql": "SELECT\n  CAST(DATE_TRUNC('month', dash_demo.support_tickets.opened_ts) AS DATE) AS \"OpenedAt\",\n  CAST(AVG(CAST(dash_demo.support_tickets.csat_score AS DECIMAL(31,4))) AS DECIMAL(31,4)) AS \"AvgCsat\"\nFROM dash_demo.support_tickets\nLEFT JOIN dash_demo.support_agents ON dash_demo.support_tickets.agent_id = dash_demo.support_agents.agent_id\nWHERE dash_demo.support_tickets.opened_ts < ${dateTo__next_day}\n  AND dash_demo.support_agents.team = ${team}\n  AND dash_demo.support_tickets.opened_ts >= ${dateFrom}\nGROUP BY\n  CAST(DATE_TRUNC('month', dash_demo.support_tickets.opened_ts) AS DATE)\nORDER BY\n  \"OpenedAt\" ASC"
        },
        "displayConfig": {
          "columnSettings": {
